error[E0428]: [CGP-E061] two `#[cgp_auto_dispatch]` traits in one module declare the method `area`
  --> src/main.rs:23:8
   |
18 |     fn area(&self) -> f64;
   |        ---- declared first here
...
23 |     fn area(&self) -> f64;
   |        ^^^^ declared again here
   |
   = note: `#[cgp_auto_dispatch]` names the items it generates after the method alone, so both traits generate `ComputeArea` and `__compute_area__`
   = help: rename `area` in one of the two traits, or declare the traits in different modules

For more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0428`.
